    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      <strong>Bandwidth is the line item that surprises most newcomers.</strong> Cross-region intra-Asia traffic runs $0.06-0.10/GB. Traffic out of Mainland China to overseas runs higher. Treat the per-instance hourly rate as the base; model egress separately if your workload serves users outside Mainland China.
    </p>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
